#. ja: うわっ！
#. de: Uaaaah!
#. fr: (Cri)
#. speaker: ALPHINAUD
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000010_ALPHINAUD:1"
msgid "[SURPRISED REAX]"
msgstr "[Ошарашенный возглас]"

#. ja: 何っ！？
#. de: Was<nbsp>...?!
#. fr: C'était quoi<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: ALISAIE
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000020_ALISAIE:1"
msgid "[SURPRISED REAX]"
msgstr "[Ошарашенный возглас]"

#. ja: きゃっ！
#. de: Aaah!
#. fr: (Cri)
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000030_RYNE:1"
msgid "[SURPRISED REAX “Ahhh!”]"
msgstr "[Испуганный вскрик: «А-а-а!»]"

#. ja: チッ  不時着するぞ……！
#. de: Das gibt 'ne Bruchlandung<nbsp>...
#. fr: On va s'écraser<nbsp>! Cramponnez-vous<nbsp>!
#. speaker: THANCRED
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000040_THANCRED:1"
msgid "Damn it! Hang on to something!"
msgstr "Чёрт! Держитесь за что-нибудь!"

#. ja: 我が役目  救うべき世界のために  お前を討つ――
#. de: Meine Pflicht ist es, die einzig wahre Welt zu retten. Daher werde ich dich vernichten!
#. fr: Mon devoir est de sauver l'unique monde qui compte... Tu vas disparaître<nbsp>!
#. speaker: ELIDIBUS
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000050_ELIDIBUS:1"
msgid "For my people─for our world, I will strike you down."
msgstr "Ради моего народа — ради нашего мира — я сражу тебя."

#. ja: 諦めるものか―― 我らの  約束を――
#. de: Mein ... Versprechen<nbsp>... Ich<nbsp>... muss es<nbsp>... Ugh<nbsp>...
#. fr: Je n'aban<shy>don<shy>ne<shy>rai pas... Je m'étais juré... juré de...
#. speaker: ELIDIBUS
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "cut_scene/053/VoiceMan_05301:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05301_000060_ELIDIBUS:1"
msgid "No... I cannot fail... I <i>will</i> not..."
msgstr "Нет... Я не могу потерпеть неудачу... Я <i>не</i>..."
